<h1 class="title">README</h1>
</header>
<h1 id="aottext-icon">Aottext <img src="data:image/vnd.microsoft.icon;base64," alt="Icon" /></h1>
<h3 id="status-of-version-2">Status of version 2:</h3>
<p>usable</p>
<p><strong>Minimal length of text is a Newline!</strong><br />
If there is none, a newline is automatically inserted!</p>
<p>Screenshot of Aottext with font &quot;Noto colored emoji&quot;:<br />
<img src="data:image/png;base64," /><br />
Content are &quot;Dingbats&quot; Unicode characters displayed with: <a href="https://github.com/jvr-ks/UnicodeTable">UnicodeTable</a></p>
